[l_english.STATE_LORE_562]
Las Pegasus is one of the only two super cities in Equestria, a city flooded with champagne, slot machines, chips, singing and dancing, bars, and tourism. In the last few years of the two sisters’ regime, the Las Pegasus Resort led by Gladmane was rapidly expanding, merging with many other resorts, and becoming the pillar enterprise of Las Pegasus tourism. However, his management also brought oppression to employees and destruction to friendship. When Gladmane’s true face was exposed to the public, he fled, and the public happily welcomed the new managers of the Las Pegasus Resort — the Flim and FLam brothers.
Soon, the public realized that the management philosophy of the two brothers was no less than Gladmane’s: now they not only oppressed employees, but also cheated customers. Unfortunately, despite their repeated deceptions, their monopoly position allowed them to continue to operate without punishment. As the Canterlot regime collapsed, they also began to dabble in politics. After upgrading from the Las Pegasus Resort to the Las Pegasus Consortium, they quickly shifted their corporate development strategy from focusing on dishonest business to focusing on political bribery. If once the ponies had a chance to unite and drive away the two brothers like they did with Gladmane, or at least boycott their products and tourist attractions, then now, their chance has gone. Las Pegasus has become an Economic Zone of the Equestria Empire, and the two brothers have obtained a special license signed by Empress Cozy Glow herself, becoming the only legal operators in the Las Pegasus area. And when Flim and Flam became the Ministers of Industry and Science and Magic, even the central empire could no longer effectively restrain them. Soon, they will buy everything here, from food, clothing, housing, transportation; to heating, water, electricity; to high-end luxury goods; to weapons, ammunition; and to government officials. There is nothing that money cannot buy.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_562]
洛马基是小马利亚唯二的超级都市，一个被香槟、老虎机、筹码、歌舞、酒吧与旅游业淹没的城市。在两姐妹政权的最后几年，乐善所领导的洛马基度假村正在快速扩张，兼并了许多其他度假村，成为了洛马基旅游业的支柱企业。但是他的管理同时带来了对员工的压迫以及对友谊的破坏。当乐善的真面目被公之于众的时候，他逃之夭夭，而民众们则高兴的迎来洛马基度假村的新管理者 —— 油嘴滑舌两兄弟。
很快，民众们反应过来，两位的经营理念对比乐善可以说是有过之而无不及：现在他们不仅压迫员工，还要诈骗顾客。奈何虽然他们一次次地欺骗，他们的垄断地位使他们依然能够不受惩罚继续经营。随着坎特洛特政权崩溃，他们也开始染指政治。从洛马基度假村升级为洛马基财团后，他们很快将他们的企业发展规划重心从不诚信经营，转移到了政治贿赂。如果说曾经小马们团结起来还有机会像赶走乐善一样赶走两兄弟，或者至少抵制他们的产品和旅游景点，那么现在，他们的机会已经一去不复返了。洛马基成为了小马利亚帝国的经济特区，两兄弟获得了和煦光流女皇亲笔签发的特许经营执照，成为了洛马基地区唯一的合法经营者。而当油嘴滑舌成为了工业部和科学与魔法部部长后，甚至连帝国中央都已经无法有效约束他们了。很快，他们将买下这里的一切，从衣食住行，到供暖供水供电，到高端奢侈品，再到武器弹药和政府官员，没有什么是钱买不到的。
